    "description": "Class III, mains-operated, self-indicating, price-computing, single or dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instruments designed for direct sales to the public. Construction: plastic, operator's keypad, stainless steel load receptor, level indicator, integrated printer; CL5200J-B has front and rear LCD displays, CL5200J-P has pole-mounted double-sided LCD displays. Devices: initial zero setting device (max 20% of Max), semi-automatic zero setting device (max 4% of Max), zero tracking device (max 4% of Max), zero indicator, net indicator, stable weight indicator, semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing device, preset tare, gravity compensation, price-computing, totalisation (including non-weighed items), PLU, fixed weight labelling, multi-vendor operation, calibration/set-up mode via sealed internal switch, self-service operation. Interfaces: RS232C, cash drawer, Ethernet, wireless LAN, USB. Software designated V2.xx.x or V3.xx.x, with xx.x reflecting non-legally relevant changes; access to legally relevant parameters only possible via the calibration switch. Access to electronics, load cell and calibration switch prevented by tamper-evident sealing solutions."
